        },
        {
          "text": " Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi akobosia ali, “Ndiruma omurume wase khukhundekekhela engila. Ne Wele Omunyali Owa Bioosi niye muyimanga oyo aliicha bwangu mu Lukaangu lwewe. Ne omurume niye muliindilila khubona oyo aliicha ababoolele endakaano yase.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAL.3.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAL.3.1"
            ]
          }
        }
